content.text:
Yes. That’s the cleaner boundary.

Right now `trace.ts` still owns too many component-specific event shapes. It should mostly be the **composition layer** and writer API, while each domain owns its own trace vocabulary.

I’d shape it like:

```ts
// cdcl.ts
export namespace Event {
  export type T =
    | { tag: "propagate"; literal: Literal; reason: Clause.T }
    | { tag: "conflict"; clause: Clause.T }
    | { tag: "decide"; literal: Literal; level: number }
    | { tag: "analyze"; conflict: Clause.T; learned: Clause.T; backtrackLevel: number }
    | { tag: "backjump"; from: number; to: number };
}
export type Event = Event.T;
```

```ts
// euf.ts
export namespace Event {
  export type T =
    | { tag: "merge"; ... }
    | { tag: "skip"; ... }
    | { tag: "congruence"; ... }
    | { tag: "conflict"; ... }
    | { tag: "scan"; ... };
}
export type Event = Event.T;
```

```ts
// arithmetic.ts
export namespace Event {
  export type T =
    | { tag: "bound"; ... }
    | { tag: "conflict"; ... }
    | { tag: "violation"; ... }
    | { tag: "pivot"; ... }
    | { tag: "infeasible"; ... }
    | { tag: "feasible" };
}
export type Event = Event.T;
```

```ts
// theory.ts
export namespace Event {
  export type T =
    | { tag: "assert"; theory: "euf" | "arithmetic"; literal: Literal; result: "ok" | "conflict"; detail: Step[] }
    | { tag: "check"; theory: "euf" | "arithmetic"; result: "ok" | "conflict"; detail: Step[] }
    | { tag: "enter"; level: number }
    | { tag: "backtrack"; to: number };

  export type Step =
    | { tag: "euf"; event: EUF.Event }
    | { tag: "arithmetic"; event: Arithmetic.Event };
}
export type Event = Event.T;
```

Then `trace.ts` becomes:

```ts
export type Event =
  | CDCL.Event
  | Theory.Event
  | Quantifier.Event
  | Result.Event;
```

That is better because `trace.ts` no longer knows every EUF/arithmetic/CDCL leaf case. It only says: “a solver trace is the sum of component traces.”

I’d also rename current `Step` to `Event` consistently unless we want a distinction where `Event` is top-level and `Step` is theory-internal. But my preference is `Event` everywhere for trace payloads.

